       VALIDATE-HOUSE-TYPE-0047.
               INSPECT WS-KEY-CHAR REPLACING ALL SPACES BY '0'.
               IF WS-STATUS-FAILED
                  PERFORM WRITE-ERROR-MESSAGE
               END-IF.
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
       FILE-ACCESS-0048.
               EXEC CICS READ FILE('KSDSHE48')
                         INTO(KSDSHE48-REC)
